human lives.

1443
01:47:20.935 --> 01:47:23.502
And so today,
we thank them.

1444
01:47:27.240 --> 01:47:29.208
<i>Famous, baby!</i>
<i>You're famous!

1445
01:48:15.456 --> 01:48:17.256
Get that toy.

1446
01:48:43.116 --> 01:48:46.318
What you barking at?

1447
